# General project rules

- Stack: Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + Storybook. Keep one coherent Tailwind setup (no duplicate PostCSS / Tailwind configs).
- Target repo: `JustWorks-Digital/citizen-wing-commander`. Do not push scaffolding to unrelated linked clones.
- Prefer small, reusable primitives under `components/ui/` before page-specific markup.
- Document new standing conventions here or as a new file under `.cursor/rules/`, and link them from `.cursor/rules/README.md`.
- Keep commits reviewable; do not force-push shared history.
